/-!
# Endpoint `(16,20)` without full facets: certificates

Generated by `design/cert/z20gen.py`.  Every facet of `P` has at most seven vertices (`nF = 7`).
Each leaf combines the facet inequality of a cost with the quadrilateral-link term
(`Ctx.facet_ineqQ`), the polar inequality, the quadrilateral-link inequality `hql` and the
global identities by `linarith`.
-/

